WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.740 line:73%
kW at kWh… pareho
lang ba 'yan?

c02
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:06.960 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:12.060 line:73%
Ang kW ay power: gaano
kabilis gumamit ng kuryente.

c04
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:17.380 line:73%
Ang kWh ay energy: gaano
karami ang nagamit.

c05
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.410 line:73%
Halimbawa, isang
100-watt na TV.

c06
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.430 line:73%
Kapag binuksan
mo nang 10 oras,

c07
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.670 line:73%
1 kWh ang nagamit nito.

c08
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:31.180 line:73%
Sa Meralco bill, kWh ang
basehan ng energy charges.

c09
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:37.210 line:73%
Kaya bago mag-solar,
kilalanin pareho: kW at kWh.

cz1
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:43.100 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.630 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
